Package: codenotch
Version: 0.2.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bogdan Doncea <donceabogdan97@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bogdancstrike/codenotch-ubuntu
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gnome-shell (>= 46), gnome-shell (<< 51), gnome-shell-extension-prefs, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-secret-1, ca-certificates
Description: AI usage notch for Ubuntu GNOME
 Screen-edge usage rings adapted from vinzdg/codenotch, with a settings
 divider, AI selection, per-provider verification, usage tooltips,
 read-only credential discovery, and Wayland/X11 GNOME integration.
 Adds clock, date, weather, battery, and system-load widgets, spring
 animations, a resting sliver, and Pango-rendered text.
